## Common Material Properties

```javascript
const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({
  uniforms: {
    /* ... */
  },
  vertexShader: '/* ... */',
  fragmentShader: '/* ... */',

  // Rendering
  transparent: true,
  opacity: 1.0,
  side: THREE.DoubleSide,
  depthTest: true,
