### Programmatic Bone Animation

```javascript
function animate() {
  const time = clock.getElapsedTime();

  // Animate bone
  const headBone = skeleton.bones.find((b) => b.name === 'Head');
  if (headBone) {
    headBone.rotation.y = Math.sin(time) * 0.3;
