```

## PointsMaterial

For point clouds.

```javascript
const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({
  color: 0xffffff,
  size: 0.1,
  sizeAttenuation: true, // Scale with distance
  map: pointTexture,
  alphaMap: alphaTexture,
  transparent: true,
  alphaTest: 0.5, // Discard pixels below threshold
