## LineBasicMaterial & LineDashedMaterial

```javascript
// Solid lines
const lineMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({
  color: 0xffffff,
  linewidth: 1, // Note: >1 only works on some systems
  linecap: 'round',
  linejoin: 'round',
});

// Dashed lines
const dashedMaterial = new THREE.LineDashedMaterial({
  color: 0xffffff,
  dashSize: 0.5,
  gapSize: 0.25,
  scale: 1,
